      "type": "string",
      "description": "Order Number (注番) - Extract the ID strictly matching the format: 'S' + YYMMDD (date) + '-' + SerialNumber (e.g., S251106-008). It is usually found in '件名' or 'No.'. Ignore any other IDs like 'MGG...'."
    },
